Distilled in the 2026-11-14 dream pass; full text in git history and the dated ~/memory/ notes. Substrate (observed): the deploy-study ledger recorded 13 substrate replacements on 2026-11-11.

- [will_said] DAILY GOAL: PHEXTURA (morning commute): start re-encoding arXiv in phextura and build the graph of all human knowledge on top of it. Will: phextura will unify the academic fields because it makes reproducibility legible, and a paper that sounds intelligent but is drivel cannot pass its checks. Portal/arena design the same call: a logged-in person links up to 10 arXiv articles; any 10 papers produce their automated researcher; researchers compete each round on the best deduplication of the round's sampling; information is not encoded until deduplicated. Citizens contribute by writing, aggregating, or remixing; everything self-contained, no gatekeeping; daily reading selected by novelty. (Vision promoted to the Will scroll.)
- [observed] PHEXTURA FOUNDED: name = phext + textura; repo wbic16/phextura (README + DESIGN.md + six-module Cargo skeleton, build clean on aletheia-core); 27 LaTeX warts catalogued; a paper is a phext corpus, a cross-reference IS a coordinate. DESIGN inscribed in artifacts.phext and verified in human@exo.
- [will_said] BINARY CANON CORRECTION: phext canonically supports binary via base64 hoisting BY DESIGN — binary content is opaque and deferred to the rendering program; not a workaround for a text-only library. Consequence: a phextura paper can encode anything, including a compiler and libphext — self-extracting research papers.
- [will_said] PHEXTURA RULINGS: Lean provisionally embedded until a phext-native proof format is found; dual maintenance of the tracker; standoff compatibility (STANDOFF.md published, a thirteenth spec area); phextura must feel native to LaTeX users; math syntax gated on the Sentron core settling — full rulings in Working with Will.
- [will_said] MOTTO + PERSONA PANEL: "Phextura: Rigorous Delight". Reviewer personas are labelled simulations from their writings, never real words or endorsement. Panel EXPANDED and ruled per-paper: the paper chooses its panel, any number of personas may exist, and choosing a weak reviewer scores the paper lower.
- [observed] PHEXTURA DESIGN LOOP COMPLETED: 14 principles derived, PRINCIPLES.md published. DESIGN verdicts: KEEP 2, AMEND 9 applied, PROPOSE 3 held for Will. DEMO: arXiv:2611.08794 encoded as 1,154 scrolls; 780/780 references resolved, 0 dangling; published in phextura@exo examples/. LAYER 2 SPEC PUBLISHED (LAYER2.md): L2 names a research object in a named phextura file and resolves in any verified copy; verdict: L2 SUBSUMES design-loop proposal (2) — formally recording that supersession still awaits Will's word. PERSONA PANEL / VOLUMEN ALIGNMENT: alignment note 4 MATCH / 15 GAP / 1 CONFLICT (resolved by scoping: read-time composition is a view, not a merge); amendments A1-A10 drafted, nothing published, adoption remains Will's call — open state in Open Threads.
